                                "example_id": "26861779-ebff-4ef9-b8b8-98959efad563",
                                "sense_id": "3714075c-4821-300a-ab35-53d5e5aeb0a3",
                                "text": "Hauliers are up in arms over higher tolls, while some doctors – including, from 9 January, specialists – could decide to close surgeries in support of the medical profession’s demands for more state support for an overloaded system."
                            }
